      "reason": "The manuscript states the population (people with suspected, probable, or confirmed covid-19), the interventions (blood products and covid-19-specific antiviral antibodies), and the comparators (one another, no intervention, placebo, or standard care), which provides the planned comparisons consistent with a PICO-style specification."
